<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_nodejs">TplAppNodejs</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate and manage menu items and actions related to Node.js within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for enabling/disabling Node.js, switching Node.js versions, and generating menus for Node.js actions. </para>
<para>
